    "intro_narrative": "The ash storms have battered Sector 4 for weeks, and the outpost's life support systems are on the verge of total failure. As a scavenger who just breached an abandoned subterranean military command center, your only hope is to discover the launch window coordinates for the last remaining automated shuttle. The facility has been locked down and left to decay since the Great Collapse, with its mainframes heavily encrypted to prevent unauthorized access. The air grows stale, and the faint hum of failing generators reminds you that time is running out. To survive, you must sift through the remnants of the command center, interact with the surviving data terminals, and restore the extraction protocols before the radiation shields give out completely. Your ultimate goal is to find the exact timezone logs required to board the shuttle and escape this dying wasteland.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
